!/README.md
!/Plugins/
!/cubeless/
/Plugins/*
!/Plugins/CubelessMCP_UE58/

**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/.vs/
/cubeless/workspaces/
/cubeless/build/
**/*.pdb
**/*.obj
